# Staged camera frames. Caterpillar product photography lives on the demo machine, not in a public
# repo; the SVG mocks beside them are committed so a fresh clone still shows something.
# See media/cameras/ATTRIBUTION.md. To commit yours instead, delete these two lines.
media/cameras/**/still.jpg
media/cameras/**/still.jpeg
media/cameras/**/still.png
media/cameras/**/still.webp
media/cameras/**/clip.*

# keep_online.ps1 state: current public link, pid, logs
.run/
